#: scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab0d5184922867a94d084510ff0b5019de1abb34527dc1309b4ceeb18b32d97c
#. default-sha256: 03a459fc32977269b6795548f44d388c2f15ef9d8e3186879d8d213c2bde0265
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sitting in the carriage waiting outside, "
"listening to the ⟪k:11⟫pitter patter⟪k:12⟫ of the rain, I gazed out at my two brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫我乘上两位哥哥准备的马车——⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫看着"
"站在雷雨中为我送行的两人。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16ceba6bffd34dbab7073a43f89b6199233419414ccebf584d2672ac9c9f3560
#. default-sha256: 55c4e334de92a20095f9433ad23a6a72dc548ed4fb0fb947946dd29260ef9f36
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t seen them in two years, but they hardly looked any different than how I remembered "
"them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫两年没见过他们，⟪k:1⟫他们的容貌却丝毫未变。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 663f4488831ed76b907b24a07b34f9ab8cf78f925eb5e6a13f8532523dd5d02a
#. default-sha256: 16703a3983e050e33cc0d71aee9243eb5c69991137c1213579a13177c2444b15
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was the only one who had changed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and dramatically, at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有我身上发生了剧变。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc81a8b753e0da11ed068da1b60135a9b79a429e76f956de73f1f8bd950ebebb
#. default-sha256: f936bce13f82773c0ea58fb2496a5d34db99b0ef1661f312f19380767e14ae85
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b6f82cf6a4aa55db83d28358504ee9fbfd89d0db9a864141bfd1f90a705317b
#. default-sha256: 13f7d6e4bbdbb07232f2c0c2574af02d68ff9304101551dd02ae4b2f2dea7f41
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking at them, I couldn’t help but remember the old days.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Playing chess with "
"Didier. Learning to draw from Georges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫看到他们的面容，⟪k:1⟫我就会想起过去。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫和迪迪尔下西洋棋，⟪k:4⟫跟乔治斯学习绘画……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56d0d5cfa51f58432ccf9a271c8304c92bc21786b10411a99c27801b9eca87da
#. default-sha256: 8f729c03f5fd1ffd5b17b4e0b056a7cf7d19c79d20dc7d2801e89d6db358dd3c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our sibling outings."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫还有，⟪k:1⟫三人一起出游的记忆。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b6c9c2c15e52e2e52038be43c69160aebc9cfd2c2d03cf9e418bb68a8b330c7
#. default-sha256: 07b4bfed425c29f2e187b424654ab7bdd8ffd7a28ac3b267339361abde220698
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the ominous sound of thunder crashing in the distance drowned out those memories."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——但是雷雨交加的庭院显得十分不祥，⟪k:1⟫仿佛要磨灭那些温馨的过去。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb4180204b430ff8fce645d7632cb835c938b96445c28da8bc3640e640ef1c8e
#. default-sha256: 270e6cccacb528420f7a637188cf69ee7cb513eca54f96d773b7ce2e41cb6dc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The mansion is several days’ travel from here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hopefully the carriage "
"isn’t too uncomfortable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫洋馆离这里有些距离。⟪k:3⟫要坐几天的马车，⟪k:4⟫忍一忍吧。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3bd312db8f38174e729685f360cf4176033c7bb45c2610699cee120273985b
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7f9d2ffc49838484f32ef2a0ebe37df4a26434b390f04daa6801b6ca8863e8b
#. default-sha256: cc6347e60178228e00aaee9319da992ca2474b168195b48c26af9ec5a54a39fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will send a package with any supplies you need once a month.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Food, "
"clothing... ⟪k:4⟫and, ⟪k:5⟫hmm, ⟪k:6⟫something to pass the time..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫必要的物资我们会每月送一次。⟪k:2⟫比如食物和衣服之类的⟪k:3⟫……之后就剩下怎么打发时间了……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3bd312db8f38174e729685f360cf4176033c7bb45c2610699cee120273985b
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffb2f26a93e46d3747e9f37ca9f733f4017eb2916688a7909c5d93f3e78918be
#. default-sha256: 43a7584c01cacbb91ca1add7381725e9887b932d0e3557a8807436d37cfae420
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If there’s anything you want, Michel, just tell me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now, ⟪k:4⟫or you can have "
"a servant pass a message on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫米歇尔……⟪k:2⟫如果有想要的东西就直说。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫可以现在说，⟪k:5⟫也可以让佣人带话。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38763bfa3f602e591628bda3e28e195d0b85b981eebc57f22d75e864348fc04d
#. default-sha256: ec8e1aa886d4e3321318d163f0c523ca098f806576eebea962f67e3238c4e8b5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t think of— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Actually, ⟪k:4⟫wait, ⟪k:5⟫I ⟪k:6⟫can⟪k:7⟫ think of one "
"thing.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I would like a chess set..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……没什么……⟪k:2⟫……不，⟪k:3⟫我想到了。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫我想要西洋棋的棋盘……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d7b33da5f4f8a92ac818c4a2b0d03baa2e6c203a0284dc137965b6a16c81f48
#. default-sha256: c1c68e887a3195fda682b55327d7c77c26a209b0b879600ff57a74977302e44a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll have one made—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫啊啊，⟪k:2⟫那我就找工匠做新的——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 076102be20dd567604a01a94a2267a9882a29438b7b7fa6b369f450ea130b8a7
#. default-sha256: 5027f1165c512b914938e82cd579670fe2d8dae173020286844288f78ca81b8c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would rather have... ⟪k:2⟫yours, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Would that be possible...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我想要……迪迪尔哥哥用过的棋盘。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫不行吗……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0c6e9c33ea56f8d2803610472776f2069aa9252276564bc5031fb19f1a83a44
#. default-sha256: fc422f6e6b10400deba3d5f947447599a9c5d18aa2ca50cd05e936535def050e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you sure you want that beaten old thing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……那个很旧了，⟪k:2⟫还有很多显眼的伤痕……可以吗？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2739fe33296568dfc89331ac4c57ffc1ddb9ff9aa3c6997268eb7b088c5baaa
#. default-sha256: 3fce9d7fa8872932ba4c1d2be90411dce9f96c8762bc373e71a08ec6354b77d2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Yes, I want that one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……我想要那个。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22b08300894ae2abeaf59104c29179e460f11a99aa56eaced7e023de5867602f
#. default-sha256: f05604f2632277ba2f43d54a94b9d4c3b710ab484cb97541fdd4487b77382487
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...All right, then. I’ll include it in the first delivery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……是吗。⟪k:2⟫好的，⟪k:3⟫那就放在第一批物资里。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95b8d4919166353ad230214db186a618d91e742f89e997b75a86878e98c8b536
#. default-sha256: 1cc1de73c232f8dedb638fed6bdd603fb6a82f2ef48ee790b3ccb4a22cb1d836
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll send you something too, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything you want, just tell me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫米歇尔，⟪k:4⟫我也送你点东西吧。⟪k:5⟫想要什么？⟪k:6⟫说说看。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 229f3b042cf6e9be8dfd485fe3157cf6593f405754bdd2cc3308739e7c43f29f
#. default-sha256: 1bf27cc6cf75ac9000126079b0e0afee81471db5fdb4933b20cb268fffd458f1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that case... ⟪k:5⟫I would like some art tools.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I’m nowhere near as much of an artist as you are,⟪k:8⟫Georges, so they don’t have to be anything "
"special."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫那就给我绘画道具吧……⟪k:4⟫我不像哥哥那样擅长绘画……给我简单准备一下就可以。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e650937f1293eb6fc4f43664b70f8064223bb9ab2239daff2b9e86f0ab6541a4
#. default-sha256: 793c19470b112b8e26409b5220d972dadc3bf374c1278684a03032bfc1e5adf5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotcha. So some canvas and, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫how ’bout some charcoal?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And when "
"you’re back, I want to see what you’ve made with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫是吗，⟪k:2⟫那就给你画布……还有木炭吧。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫如果画了什么——⟪k:5⟫等米歇尔回来的时候给我"
"看看吧。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a1889c544136ebca4d2be2e4a38f2aeec6b0a10adb5ea00fdd7657d79c68820
#. default-sha256: 3228b637316d4c11f079c1e42caf89775d115be7d71609150f1e99f060a58aa5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……好的。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 852fc7ad6db1352811d292502e38824d9da35c402a0e81fe66cfd7fb9ae98eb5
#. default-sha256: 1d2797510ac056cbe591bbdf81fd0bdb80d0a9759b4d1348f2aa8a866fd20b34
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know this is already hard enough on you, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but I need "
"to ask you to do something for me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avoid making contact with anyone who doesn’t already "
"know about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫米歇尔……⟪k:5⟫我知道这是委屈你了，⟪k:6⟫我有个请求。⟪k:7⟫尽可能不要和不知内"
"情的人扯上关系。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ec27c4861b171d3e4b505f1593165b006b4dc90d0cd378a002eddf1cb265791
#. default-sha256: a7ee0f6119189595f7b7a7883b06ec194f8c86eb9b6427f226b77137ff7d7503
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So... ⟪k:2⟫I can’t talk to anybody but the servants?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫就是说……⟪k:2⟫不要在佣人以外的人面前现身吗？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0093026E_84C6_4E0C_B5AE_68C8DD4C7C2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeb32443e1be0088f8c5e01347465e9a35b94e4e263cfbeae0761107f8448493
